A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.23;
son of: Shobal (H7732);
brother of: Alvan (H5935), Ebal (H5858B), Shepho (H8195) and Onam (H0208)
Also named: <i>ma.na.chat</i> (מָנַ֫חַת "Manahathite" H4506)
